        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Heat, at cogen 200kWe diesel, allocation heat</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Heat, at cogen 200kWe diesel, allocation heat
The multioutput-process 'diesel, burned in cogen 200kWe diesel SCR, allocation heat' delivers the coproducts 'heat, at cogen 200kWe diesel, allocation heat' and 'electricity, at cogen 200kWe diesel, allocation heat'.;
UUID: 0c6b1c10-ace3-308b-a245-6665946e525d
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology available on market.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0c6b1c10-ace3-308b-a245-6665946e525d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
